## 8.3.5. SSL/TLS Pinning Mimarisi ve Sertifika Kontrolleri

### 8.3.5.1. Tehdit Perspektifi: MITM Saldırıları

Standart TLS doğrulaması, işletim sistemi tarafından güvenilen bir Kök Sertifika Otoritesine (Root CA) dayanır. Saldırganlar şu yöntemlerle bu güven zincirini kırabilir:

- Root'lu/jailbreak'li cihazda sahte CA sertifikası yükleyerek
- Burp Suite, mitmproxy gibi proxy araçlarıyla trafiği yakalayarak
- Zafiyetli bir CA'yı ele geçirerek

### 8.3.5.2. SSL/TLS Pinning

**SSL/TLS Pinning**, uygulamanın yalnızca önceden tanımlanmış sertifikaları veya public key'leri kabul etmesini sağlayan bir savunma mekanizmasıdır. OWASP, pinning'i **savunma derinliğinin** bir parçası olarak önerir.

**Android (OkHttp) - Public Key Pinning**:

```kotlin
// OkHttp ile Certificate Pinning
val client = OkHttpClient.Builder()
    .certificatePinner(
        CertificatePinner.Builder()
            .add("api.example.com", "sha256/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=")
            .add("api.example.com", "sha256/BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB=")
            .build()
    )
    .build()
```

**Android (Network Security Config - XML)** :

```xml
<!-- res/xml/network_security_config.xml -->
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<network-security-config>
    <domain-config>
        <domain includeSubdomains="true">api.example.com</domain>
        <pin-set expiration="2026-12-31">
            <pin digest="SHA-256">AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=</pin>
            <pin digest="SHA-256">BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB=</pin>
        </pin-set>
    </domain-config>
</network-security-config>
```

**iOS (URLSession) - Public Key Pinning**:

```swift
class PinnedURLSessionDelegate: NSObject, URLSessionDelegate {
    func urlSession(_ session: URLSession, 
                    didReceive challenge: URLAuthenticationChallenge,
                    completionHandler: @escaping (URLSession.AuthChallengeDisposition, URLCredential?) -> Void) {
        
        guard let serverTrust = challenge.protectionSpace.serverTrust,
              let certificate = SecTrustGetCertificateAtIndex(serverTrust, 0) else {
            completionHandler(.cancelAuthenticationChallenge, nil)
            return
        }
        
        // Public Key Hash Karşılaştırması
        let publicKey = SecCertificateCopyKey(certificate)
        let publicKeyData = SecKeyCopyExternalRepresentation(publicKey, nil) as Data
        let publicKeyHash = SHA256(publicKeyData).base64EncodedString()
        
        let pinnedPublicKeyHashes = [
            "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=",
            "BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB="
        ]
        
        if pinnedPublicKeyHashes.contains(publicKeyHash) {
            completionHandler(.useCredential, URLCredential(trust: serverTrust))
        } else {
            completionHandler(.cancelAuthenticationChallenge, nil)
        }
    }
}
```

### 8.3.5.3. Pinning Zorlukları ve En İyi Uygulamalar

| Zorluk | Çözüm |
|--------|-------|
| Sertifika yenileme | Birden fazla pin (aktif + yedek) saklama |
| Uygulama güncelleme zorunluluğu | Dinamik pinning (OTA sertifika güncellemesi) |
| Public Key Hash hesaplama | `openssl x509 -in cert.pem -pubkey -noout \| openssl pkey -pubin -outform der \| openssl dgst -sha256 -binary \| base64` |

### 8.3.5.4. SSL Pinning Bypass Teknikleri (Saldırgan Perspektifi)

Saldırganlar Frida kullanarak SSL pinning'i bypass edebilir:

```javascript
